# s34_config_mono.scene — Snapshot_034 (W2 / W6) (docs/VISUAL_DIFF_1.9.4.md Part 2 §11).
# Part 2 shots were taken on "B1t Crunch3r - Dimension X" (not in the
# fixtures): checks on its content are @content. Themes and fonts are set
# with the sim's "theme N" / "font N" script lines (no Config key flow).
stock Snapshot_034.png
project Jude Frankum - Chill Out Room
script
  wait 300
  theme 1              # Monochrome (stock: Config > General > Display theme picker)
  tap CONFIG
  tap F2               # General
  tap F6 x2            # cursor on "Display theme"
end
